{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00693","headline":"郊庙歌辞 德明兴圣庙乐章 德明酌献 · 李舒","name":"郊庙歌辞 德明兴圣庙乐章 德明酌献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清庙奕奕，和乐雍雍。\n器尊牺象，礼属宗公。\n白水方祼，黄流在中。\n谟明之德，万古清风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李舒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}